# TuxGuitar

## Description

TuxGuitarAdvanced is an Open Source multitrack tablature editor and player written in Java.
It is a fork of TuxGuitar (https://github.com/helge17/tuxguitar) that adds interactive practice
with audio recognition (Tools > Interactive Practice).
Source code and releases of the fork: https://github.com/krl91/tuxguitaradvanced

